OL,5,G1845 Snooker: Champion of Champions
OL,6,     FAfter a week in which the best
OL,7,     Fhave battled the best, the
OL,8,     FChampion of Champions reaches its
OL,9,     Fconclusion. The first player to 10
OL,10,     Fframes will lift the trophy and
OL,11,     Fclaim the title.
